  "body": "# Gaoxy 0.12.1\n\nNative HTTP/2 uses the documented first-party `HTTP.HTTP2.HPACK` codec from\n`http_core >= 0.21.16` instead of HPAX. The integration preserves decoder state,\nheader bounds and zero-capacity response encoding.\n\nThe HTTP/TLS/QUIC dependency cohort advances together to `0.21.16`.\nThe `elixir_quic_http3`, `http_fetch` and `http_web_socket` package requirements\nuse `~> 0.21` instead of exact pins. The new direct `http_core` requirement uses\nthe same compatibility range with a `>= 0.21.16` floor.\nThe unsupported `optional` flag is removed from the umbrella `gaoxy_http3`\ndependency; the staged `gaoxy_test` Hex extension remains optional.\n\nAll six Hex distributions and the standalone application advance together to\n`0.12.1`.\n",
  "created_at": "2026-10-22T10:17:25Z",
